sequenceDiagram
    participant MM as ModelMesh
    participant KS as KServe<br/>(Knative Eventing)
    participant TrustyAI as TrustyAI Service<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant Reconciler as Payload Reconciler<br/>(in-process)
    participant DS as DataSource
    participant Store as Storage Backend<br/>(PVC / MinIO / DB)
    participant Scheduler as PrometheusScheduler<br/>(@Scheduled 5s)
    participant Micrometer as Micrometer Gauges<br/>(trustyai_* metrics)
    participant Prom as Prometheus<br/>(ServiceMonitor)
    participant Client as Client / Dashboard

    Note over MM,Store: Flow 1: ModelMesh Inference Payload Ingestion
    MM->>TrustyAI: POST /consumer/kserve/v2<br/>HTTP 8080/TCP, No Auth
    TrustyAI->>Reconciler: ConsumerEndpoint delegates<br/>to ModelMeshInferencePayloadReconciler
    Reconciler->>Reconciler: Match input/output pairs<br/>by inference ID
    Reconciler->>DS: Persist complete observation
    DS->>Store: Write (CSV file / S3 PUT / JDBC INSERT)

    Note over KS,Store: Flow 2: KServe CloudEvent Payload Ingestion
    KS->>TrustyAI: HTTP CloudEvent<br/>org.kubeflow.serving.inference.request
    KS->>TrustyAI: HTTP CloudEvent<br/>org.kubeflow.serving.inference.response
    TrustyAI->>Reconciler: @Funq handlers delegate<br/>to KServeInferencePayloadReconciler
    Reconciler->>Reconciler: Match request/response<br/>by inference ID
    Reconciler->>DS: Persist complete observation
    DS->>Store: Write (CSV file / S3 PUT / JDBC INSERT)

    Note over Scheduler,Prom: Flow 3: Scheduled Metric Computation & Prometheus Scraping
    loop Every 5s (configurable)
        Scheduler->>DS: Fetch inference data per model
        DS->>Store: Read stored observations
        Store-->>DS: Observation data
        DS-->>Scheduler: Model inference data
        Scheduler->>Scheduler: Compute fairness/drift metrics<br/>(SPD, DIR, KS, MMD, etc.)
        Scheduler->>Micrometer: Publish gauge values<br/>(trustyai_spd, trustyai_dir, ...)
    end
    Prom->>TrustyAI: GET /q/metrics<br/>HTTP 8080/TCP, Bearer SA token
    TrustyAI-->>Prom: Prometheus exposition format<br/>(pre-computed gauge values)

    Note over Client,Store: Flow 4: On-Demand Metric Request
    Client->>TrustyAI: POST /metrics/group/fairness/spd<br/>HTTP 8080/TCP, No Auth
    TrustyAI->>DS: Fetch inference data for model
    DS->>Store: Read stored observations
    Store-->>DS: Observation data
    DS-->>TrustyAI: Model data
    TrustyAI->>TrustyAI: Compute requested metric
    TrustyAI->>Scheduler: Register for recurring computation
    TrustyAI-->>Client: Metric result (JSON)
